Improved: IBTK::LDataManager::spread() and IBAMR::IMPMethod::spreadForce() spread each marker once into cell-centered and side-centered data and sum the values in ghost cells into the patches that own them. Force spread across periodic boundaries is no longer dropped, and force spread outside physical boundaries is folded back into the domain by the transpose of the boundary fill. IBAMR::IBFEMethod and IBAMR::IBFESurfaceMethod now apply the transpose of the boundary fill within the accumulation of ghost values.
<br>
(Boyce Griffith, 2026/10/06)
